---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'What exactly is OpenClaw?',
    a: 'OpenClaw is an open-source, self-hosted AI agent. It connects Claude or GPT to your messaging apps (WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord) and gives it tools to take real actions: reading email, managing tasks, browsing the web, running automations. It works in the background. You just message it like you would a person.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do I need to be technical to use it?',
    a: 'No. The install is one command, but the configuration is where most people get stuck. That is the part I handle. After setup, you interact with your assistant through WhatsApp or Telegram. No terminal, no config files.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How is this different from ChatGPT or Copilot?',
    a: 'ChatGPT answers when you ask. OpenClaw sends you a morning briefing before you ask, monitors competitors weekly, transcribes your meetings when you drop in an audio file. It also runs on your own machine, so your data is not stored by anyone else.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Is my data secure?',
    a: 'Yes. Self-hosted means OpenClaw runs on your machine, not on a vendor server. Your emails, documents, and conversations stay with you. I also configure exactly which tools your assistant can and cannot access during setup.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does it cost to run after setup?',
    a: 'OpenClaw is free and open-source. The ongoing cost is the AI model API, usually Anthropic Claude. For a working executive, that typically runs $20 to $80 a month depending on how much you use it. Less than most SaaS subscriptions.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section-pad border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="container-sm">
    <p class="text-accent text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">FAQ</p>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-14">Common questions.</h2>

    <div class="space-y-0">
      {faqs.map((faq, i) => (
        <details class={`group py-6 ${i < faqs.length - 1 ? 'border-b border-white/5' : ''}`}>
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none">
            <span class="font-medium text-white pr-6">{faq.q}</span>
            <span class="text-accent flex-shrink-0 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-xl leading-none">+</span>
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">{faq.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
